-- CandyFarm (LocalScript in StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts)
-- Halloween auto farm with a dark red themed UI.
--   [N]  pause / resume everything
--   [M]  open the menu (toggles + stats + live log)
--
-- Features (each has its own toggle):
--   Auto Candy         -> teleports to every "Candy" in Workspace.HalloweenCandy (Tools / Models / Parts / Configurations)
--   Auto Trick or Treat-> holds E on every "DoorTreeTemplate" in Workspace.HalloweenDoorTrees (5s gap between trees)
--   Auto Pinata        -> sticks to "Penyta" things in Workspace.Live and attacks until they break
--   Auto Zombie        -> same thing for "Halloween Zombie" in Workspace.Live
-- Priority: Candy > Pinata/Zombie > Trick or Treat.
-- Teleports / actions WAIT while you are ragdolled and continue once you've gotten up.
--
-- FIX: collectCandy() was never defined (caused "attempt to call a nil value" in step()). Added below.

